; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; RespawnDelay.ucl - import cache for the mutators menu.
;
; NB: "ucc make" only exports this file on the very first build and never
; regenerates an existing one - so the texts here must be maintained by
; hand. That is why this file is committed to the repository, and why
; make.sh simply deploys it to System/ unchanged.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Mutator=(ClassName=RespawnDelay.RespawnDelay,IconMaterialName=MutatorArt.nosym,FriendlyName=RespawnDelay.RespawnDelay.FriendlyName,Description=RespawnDelay.RespawnDelay.Description,FallbackName="Respawn Delay",FallbackDesc="Forces players to wait before respawning. Team games respawn in batches on a global 10s cycle: die with 5s or more left in the cycle and you spawn when it ends, otherwise your wait is exactly 10s (never longer). Solo games use a fixed 5s. While waiting you are a spectator (FIRE to cycle views).")
